# Mitram Ayurveda — Hospital Management System
# Windsurf Rules File v1.0

## Project Overview
Multi-tenant Ayurvedic Hospital Management System.
Multiple hospitals and branches. Each hospital is fully isolated — own data,
own forms, own inventory, own users.
Full SRS is at docs/SRS.md — always read it before building any module.

## Tech Stack
- Runtime: Node.js 20.x
- Cloud: AWS
- Architecture: Serverless (Serverless Framework — serverless-offline for local dev)
- Compute: AWS Lambda
- API: AWS API Gateway (REST)
- Database: AWS DynamoDB (already installed — @aws-sdk/client-dynamodb, lib-dynamodb)
- Auth: AWS Cognito (already installed — @aws-sdk/client-cognito-identity-provider)
- HTTP Framework: Express.js (already installed)
- Validation: Zod or jsonschema (jsonschema already installed)
- Storage: AWS S3 (for PDFs, reports, documents)
- Queue: AWS SQS (for token/queue management)
- Bundler: esbuild via serverless-esbuild (already installed)
- PDF Generation: To be decided — add as Lambda layer
- Scheduling: node-schedule (already installed)
- Date/Time: Luxon (already installed)
- UUID: uuid (already installed)
- Frontend: Separate project — not in this repo

