## Roles
1. Super Admin — Developer level. Unrestricted access to all hospitals, all data,
   all configs, all logs. Can impersonate any role. Seeded in DB, not created via UI.
2. Hospital Admin — Manages their own hospital only.
3. Doctor (Vaidya) — Consultations, prescriptions, Panchakarma, clinical forms.
4. Assistant Doctor — Same as Doctor access in v1.0.
5. Receptionist — Patient registration and token queue only.

All roles have access to all modules in v1.0.
RBAC will be enforced in a future version.

